OL,3,GNEWSAMum sentenced for killing her
OL,4,Athree children
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe wept as details of the fatal
OL,7,Finjuries were read out, and Judge
OL,8,FJustice Linden - describing her as a
OL,9,Floving mother - said: "It is my view
OL,10,Fyou would not have done what you have
OL,11,Fif you were well."
